OL,3,GNEWSA100-year-old fire station put up
OL,4,Afor sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former fire station in north
OL,7,FLiverpool has gone on the market after
OL,8,Fits owner said redevelopment plans had
OL,9,Fbecome unaffordable.
OL,11,FBest Care Liverpool, which bought the
OL,12,F100-year-old Aintree Fire Station on
OL,13,FLongmoor Lane in Fazakerley, unveiled
OL,14,Fplans in January 2025 for four flats
OL,15,Fand offices.
OL,17,FHowever, planning permission for the
OL,18,Fhousing scheme was refused.
OL,20,FRevised plans for offices were later
OL,21,Fapproved by Liverpool City Council.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
